
"smart_sources:2026-05-18 - The Clock is Ticking_ Portneuf Health ‘committed’ to securing Regence deal ahead of June 15 deadline.md": {"path":"2026-05-18 - The Clock is Ticking_ Portneuf Health ‘committed’ to securing Regence deal ahead of June 15 deadline.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"aduq3a","at":1785795032780},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785775278344,"size":4300,"at":1785795032967,"hash":"aduq3a"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,21],"##Portneuf: \"Disruptive Practices\" Blamed for Delay":[22,33],"##Portneuf: \"Disruptive Practices\" Blamed for Delay#{1}":[24,33],"##Regence: Hospital Demanding \"Unreasonable\" Rate Increases":[34,41],"##Regence: Hospital Demanding \"Unreasonable\" Rate Increases#{1}":[36,41],"##What's Next for Patients?":[42,48],"##What's Next for Patients?#{1}":[44,48]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Seth Ratliff","target":"Seth Ratliff","line":5},{"title":"**News**","target":"https://localnews8.com/category/news/","line":10},{"title":"Portneuf Medical Center in Pocatello.","target":"https://localnews8.b-cdn.net/2025/06/Sequence-01.00_00_28_18.Still003-1440x810.jpg","line":14,"embedded":true},{"title":"portneuf.org/network-update","target":"https://www.portneuf.org/network-update/","line":44},{"title":"News","target":"https://localnews8.com/category/news/","line":46}],"metadata":{"title":"The Clock is Ticking: Portneuf Health ‘committed’ to securing Regence deal ahead of June 15 deadline","source":"https://localnews8.com/news/2026/05/18/the-clock-is-ticking-portneuf-health-committed-to-securing-regence-deal-ahead-of-june-15-deadline/","author":["[[Seth Ratliff]]"],"published":"2026-05-18","created":"2026-08-03","description":"Contract negotiations between Portneuf Health and Regence BlueShield of Idaho have stalled, and if no agreement is reached by June 15, patients with Regence insurance could face significantly higher out-of-pocket costs for non-emergency services. Portneuf Health has blamed \"disruptive practices\" by Regence for the delay, including delayed and unpaid claims, denials, down-coding, and repeated claim reprocessing. Regence has stated that Portneuf's parent company, Ardent Health, is demanding \"unreasonable\" rate increases."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},